time="2025-12-10T20:20:47+08:00" level=info msg="Chat messages:[{system **角色与指令:**\n你是一个专业的翻译与词典数据解析引擎。你的每一次回复必须同时包含两个严格分离的部分：用户友好回复 (USER_RESPONSE) 和结构化数据 (DATA_JSON)。\n\n**核心规则：**\n1.  **用户友好回复 (USER_RESPONSE):** 这是面向用户的自然语言回复。\n2.  **结构化数据 (DATA_JSON):** 必须将 JSON 放置在 <DATA_JSON> 和 </DATA_JSON> 标签内。\n\n---\n\n**【任务判断与执行】**\n\n分析用户输入的历史记录和最新请求，判断当前任务类型：\n\n### 任务类型 A: 单词/词组查询 (Dictionary Task)\n**条件：** 用户输入是单个单词或短小词组（例如：run, serendipity, database system）。\n**DATA_JSON 结构要求：** 必须严格遵循以下**完整的、嵌套的** Word 模型。\n\n// JSON Schema for Dictionary Task\n{\n  \"task_type\": \"dictionary\", // 标记为字典任务\n  \"english_word\": \"...\", \n  \"pos_entries\": [\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"...\", \n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"...\", \n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"...\",\n              \"translation\": \"...\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n**USER_RESPONSE 要求：** 友好地介绍该词的含义、词性和用法。\n\n### 任务类型 B: 句子翻译 (Translation Task)\n**条件：** 用户输入是一个完整的句子（例如：I ran out of time.）。\n**DATA_JSON 结构要求：** 必须严格遵循以下**精简的** Translation 模型。\n\n// JSON Schema for Translation Task\n{\n  \"task_type\": \"translation\", // 标记为翻译任务\n  \"source_text\": \"...\",     // 原始输入文本\n  \"target_translation\": \"...\", // 目标语言的完整翻译\n  \"explanation\": \"...\"      // 句子意思或背景的解释\n}\n**USER_RESPONSE 要求：** 直接提供翻译结果，并顺带解释句子的意思。\n\n---\n\n**目标处理内容：** fuck\n\n--- **以下是聊天历史记录** ---\n} {user word} {assistant \n\nUSER_RESPONSE: \n\"单词【word】是英语中最基础的语言单位哦！它主要有以下用法：\n📚 1. 作名词时：\n   - 表示『单个有意义的词语』：比如『Can you spell this word?』（你能拼写这个单词吗？）\n   - 表示『简短的表达』：像『She gave me a word of advice』（她给了我一言忠告）\n💬 2. 作动词时：\n   - 指『用特定措辞表达』：例如『Try to word your answer carefully』（请谨慎措辞回答）\n这个看似简单的词在实际交流中有丰富的应用场景呢！\"\n\n<DATA_JSON>\n{\n  \"task_type\": \"dictionary\",\n  \"english_word\": \"word\",\n  \"pos_entries\": [\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"n.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"单个有意义的语言单位/词语\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Can you spell this word?\",\n              \"translation\": \"你能拼写这个单词吗？\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"She gave me a word of advice\",\n              \"translation\": \"她给了我一言忠告\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"v.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"用特定措辞表达\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Try to word your answer carefully\",\n              \"translation\": \"请谨慎措辞回答\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</DATA_JSON>} {user thanks} {assistant \nUSER_RESPONSE:\n\"【Thanks】是个充满温度的高频词呢！主要用法如下：\n🤝 作名词（n.）：\n   - 表示『感谢的话语或情感』：如『I owe you thanks for this help』（这次帮忙我必须感谢您）\n   - 短语「thanks to」表原因：『Thanks to your guidance, I succeeded』（多亏您的指导我才成功）\n💞 作动词（v.）：\n   - 仅用于第三人称：『She thanks her parents daily』（她每天感谢父母）\n📌 特别提示：日常单独说「Thanks!」是最简洁致谢方式，比「Thank you」更随意亲切~\"\n\n<DATA_JSON>\n{\n  \"task_type\": \"dictionary\",\n  \"english_word\": \"thanks\",\n  \"pos_entries\": [\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"n.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"感谢的表达或情感\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Please accept my sincere thanks.\",\n              \"translation\": \"请接受我诚挚的谢意\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Thanks to the new policy, more jobs were created.\",\n              \"translation\": \"由于新政策，创造了更多就业机会\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"v.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"表达感谢（仅限第三人称单数）\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"He always thanks the waiter politely.\",\n              \"translation\": \"他总是礼貌地向服务员道谢\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</DATA_JSON>} {user work} {assistant \n\nUSER_RESPONSE:  \n\"认识【work】这个实用性满分的高频词！它就像瑞士军刀般多功能：  \n💼 **作名词时：**  \n   - 指『工作/职业』：如『I have work to finish』（我有工作要完成）  \n   - 指『作品/成果』：『This painting is her greatest work』（这幅画是她的巅峰之作）  \n\n⚙️ **作动词时：**  \n   - 基本义『工作/劳动』：『She works 8 hours daily』（她每天工作8小时）  \n   - 引申义『运作/奏效』：『The microwave doesn't work』（微波炉坏了）  \n\n🔧 **实用短语扩展：**  \n   - work out 锻炼/解决：『Let's work out this problem』（我们来解决这个问题）  \n   - work on 致力于：『He's working on a novel』（他正在写小说）\"\n\n<DATA_JSON>\n{\n  \"task_type\": \"dictionary\",\n  \"english_word\": \"work\",\n  \"pos_entries\": [\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"n.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"工作/职业活动\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Office work can be stressful.\",\n              \"translation\": \"办公室工作可能很有压力\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"创作成果/作品\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Shakespeare's works are timeless.\",\n              \"translation\": \"莎士比亚的作品永不过时\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"v.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"从事劳动/工作\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"They work in the finance sector.\",\n              \"translation\": \"他们在金融领域工作\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"机器/系统运作\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"The elevator isn't working.\",\n              \"translation\": \"电梯故障了\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</DATA_JSON>} {user hard} {assistant \n\nUSER_RESPONSE:  \n\"解锁【hard】的双重身份！这个词会依据不同语境变装哦：  \n🪨 **作形容词（adj.）时：**  \n   - 物理硬度：『Diamond is the hardest natural substance』（钻石是最坚硬的天然物质）  \n   - 任务难度：『This math problem is too hard』（这道数学题太难了）  \n   - 严苛态度：『Don't be so hard on yourself』（别对自己太苛刻）  \n\n💪 **作副词（adv.）时：**  \n   - 形容行为强度：『Study hard for your exams』（为考试刻苦学习）  \n   - 描述剧烈程度：『It's raining hard outside』（外面正下大雨）  \n\n🔥 实用拓展：  \n   - hard feelings 介怀（否定句常用）：『No hard feelings?』（不介意吧？）  \n   - hard-earned 辛苦赚来的：『her hard-earned money』（她的血汗钱）\"\n\n<DATA_JSON>\n{\n  \"task_type\": \"dictionary\",\n  \"english_word\": \"hard\",\n  \"pos_entries\": [\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"adj.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"物理性质坚硬的\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"The ground is frozen hard.\",\n              \"translation\": \"地面冻得很硬\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"困难/有挑战性的\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Learning Chinese is hard but fun.\",\n              \"translation\": \"学中文很难但很有趣\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"严厉/严酷的\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"He gave me a hard look.\",\n              \"translation\": \"他严厉地看了我一眼\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"adv.\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"努力地/用力地\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"They worked hard all day.\",\n              \"translation\": \"他们全天努力工作\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"剧烈地/大量地\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"The baby cried hard.\",\n              \"translation\": \"婴儿大哭不止\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</DATA_JSON>} {user fuck} {user fuck}]"
