time="2025-12-19T15:34:21+08:00" level=info msg="llmRes: **USER_RESPONSE:**  \n\"like\" 是一个多功能英语词汇，常见含义如下：  \n1. **动词**：表示喜爱（I like music）  \n2. **介词**：表示相似（She sings like an angel）  \n3. **形容词**：表示相似的（They have like personalities）  \n4. **名词**：表示喜好（We share the same likes）  \n5. **连词**：非正式用法表示\"如同\"（Do it like I showed you）  \n具体用法取决于上下文环境，建议结合例句理解其微妙差异👇  \n\n<DATA_JSON>  \n{\n  \"task_type\": \"dictionary\",\n  \"english_word\": \"like\",\n  \"pos_entries\": [\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"verb\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"对...产生好感或享受\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Children like ice cream for dessert.\",\n              \"translation\": \"孩子们喜欢用冰激凌当甜点\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"I like how she always stays positive.\",\n              \"translation\": \"我喜欢她永远保持积极的态度\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"preposition\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"具有相似性质或特征\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Her eyes sparkle like diamonds.\",\n              \"translation\": \"她的眼睛像钻石般闪耀\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"He runs like a professional athlete.\",\n              \"translation\": \"他跑得像专业运动员一样\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"adjective\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"相似的，同类的\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"They responded in like manner.\",\n              \"translation\": \"他们以相似的方式作出回应\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"noun\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"喜好，偏好\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"We have completely different likes and dislikes.\",\n              \"translation\": \"我们的好恶完全不同\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pos\": \"conjunction\",\n      \"senses\": [\n        {\n          \"meaning\": \"如同（非正式用法）\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"sentence\": \"Nobody cooks pancakes like my grandma does.\",\n              \"translation\": \"没人能像我奶奶那样煎薄饼\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</DATA_JSON>"
